    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You manipulate and sculpt hardlight to take any shape you can imagine. You can use this ability to bring stories to life, or recreate past events. Your spotlight shines on allies and enemies both, bolstering or hindering them. All the while, you infuse magic into the stagecraft of your chosen platform to direct the stage of battle.</p>",
